    "design_md": "# Publicissapient — Design System Reference\n> Reverse-engineered by ExtractDesign Studio\n\n## Color Palette\n- `--color-surface-base` → `#000000` (surface-base)\n- `--color-surface-elevated` → `#030712` (surface-elevated)\n- `--color-blue` → `#101828` (blue)\n- `--color-blue-02` → `#1e2939` (blue-02)\n- `--color-neutral` → `#444444` (neutral)\n- `--color-feedback-danger` → `#9f0712` (feedback-danger)\n- `--color-text-muted` → `#4a5565` (text-muted)\n- `--color-neutral-02` → `#666666` (neutral-02)\n- `--color-blue-03` → `#0c63ea` (blue-03)\n- `--color-blue-04` → `#6a7282` (blue-04)\n- `--color-red` → `#e90130` (red)\n- `--color-brand-primary` → `#2b7fff` (brand-primary)\n- `--color-neutral-03` → `#949494` (neutral-03)\n- `--color-feedback-warning` → `#ff6900` (feedback-warning)\n- `--color-blue-05` → `#99a1af` (blue-05)\n- `--color-feedback-success` → `#00c950` (feedback-success)\n- `--color-text-subtle` → `#d1d5dc` (text-subtle)\n- `--color-yellow` → `#fee685` (yellow)\n- `--color-neutral-04` → `#e5e7eb` (neutral-04)\n- `--color-text-on-dark` → `#ffffff` (text-on-dark)\n\n## Typography\n- `sans`: ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif,\"Apple Color Emoji\",\"Segoe UI Emoji\",\"Segoe UI Symbol\",\"Noto Color Emoji\"\n- `mono`: ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,\"Liberation Mono\",\"Courier New\",monospace\n\n## Border Radius\n- `--radius-none`: 0\n- `--radius-sm`: 3px\n- `--radius-DEFAULT`: .25rem\n- `--radius-md`: .375rem\n- `--radius-lg`: .5rem\n- `--radius-xl`: .75rem\n\n## Spacing Scale\n- `--space-0`: 0px\n- `--space-1px`: 1px\n- `--space-1_6px`: 1.6px\n- `--space-2px`: 2px\n- `--space-1`: 4px\n- `--space-5px`: 5px\n- `--space-6px`: 6px\n- `--space-7px`: 7px\n- `--space-2`: 8px\n- `--space-9_71px`: 9.71px\n- `--space-10px`: 10px\n- `--space-3`: 12px\n\n---\n> All design assets remain property of their respective owners.",
    "react_components": "// Next.js App Router Components for publicissapient.com\n// Optimized for Core Web Vitals (LCP < 2.5s, CLS < 0.1, INP < 200ms)\n// Generated by ExtractDesign Studio\n\nimport React from 'react';\nimport Image from 'next/image';\n\n'use client';\nexport function Button({ children, variant = 'primary', className = '', ...props }) {\n  const styles = {\n    primary: { backgroundColor: 'var(--color-brand-primary, #ffffff)', color: '#fff', border: 'none', padding: '10px 20px', borderRadius: '8px', fontWeight: 600, cursor: 'pointer' },\n    secondary: { backgroundColor: 'transparent', border: '1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.3)', padding: '10px 20px', borderRadius: '8px', fontWeight: 600, cursor: 'pointer' },\n  };\n  return <button style={styles[variant]} className={className} {...props}>{children}</button>;\n}\n\nexport function Hero({ headline, description, ctaText = 'Get Started', imageSrc }) {\n  return (\n    <section style={{ padding: '64px 24px', textAlign: 'center', maxWidth: '960px', margin: '0 auto' }}>\n      <h1 style={{ fontSize: '42px', fontWeight: 700, marginBottom: '16px' }}>{headline}</h1>\n      <p style={{ fontSize: '18px', opacity: 0.8, marginBottom: '28px' }}>{description}</p>\n      {imageSrc && <Image src={imageSrc} alt={headline} width={800} height={450} priority />}\n      <Button>{ctaText}</Button>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n"
